- **웹훅 설정**
  cd stacks/eks/eks_dev/k8s
  terraform output -raw argocd_webhook_github_secret

- **argocd 현재 상태**
```sh
argocd context
```

- **ECR 이미지 저장소 목록**
```sh
PROFILE=alan-supplies
aws ecr describe-repositories --profile $PROFILE --region ap-northeast-2 --query 'repositories[].repositoryName' --output table
```

- **ECR 저장소 이미지 목록 json**
```sh
PROFILE=alan-supplies
aws ecr describe-images \
  --repository-name dev \
  --profile $PROFILE \
  --region ap-northeast-2 \
  --query 'imageDetails[].{Tags:imageTags,Pushed:imagePushedAt}' \
```
- **ECR 저장소 이미지 목록 table**
```sh
PROFILE=alan-supplies
PREFIX=${PREFIX:-public-server-dev}

aws ecr describe-images \
  --repository-name dev \
  --profile "$PROFILE" \
  --region ap-northeast-2 \
  --output json |
jq -r --arg prefix "$PREFIX" '
  ["IMAGE TAGS", "PUSHED AT"],
  (
    .imageDetails[]
    | select(any(.imageTags[]?; startswith($prefix)))
    | [(.imageTags | join(", ")), .imagePushedAt]
  )
  | @tsv
' | column -t -s $'\t'
```

- 배포된 이미지가 ECR 최신 태그와 같은지
```sh
DEPLOYMENT_NAME=admin-server-dev1
kubectl get deploy $DEPLOYMENT_NAME -n default \
  -o jsonpath='{.spec.template.spec.containers[0].image}{"\n"}'
```

- Image Updater가 만든 write-back 커밋
```sh
DEPLOYMENT_PATH=gymboxx/admin-server/values-dev.yaml
gh api "repos/suppliesfitness/platform-gitops/commits?path=apps/$DEPLOYMENT_PATH&per_page=5" \
  --jq '.[] | "\(.sha[0:7]) \(.commit.message | gsub("\n+"; " ｜ "))"'
```

- ArgoCD 앱 상태 (Synced/Healthy 여야 함)
```sh
APPLICATION_NAME=gymboxx-admin-server-dev
kubectl get app $APPLICATION_NAME -n argocd \
  -o custom-columns='SYNC:.status.sync.status,HEALTH:.status.health.status' \
  --context=arn:aws:eks:ap-northeast-2:699016088228:cluster/eks_dev
```
